  "body": "I noticed we have a lot of \"`document`\", \"`<code>Document</code>`\", and \"`<code>Document</code> object`\". We should probably pick one and stick with it. I vote for `<span>document</span>` linking to https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document as that reads the easiest and is easiest to remember.\n\n(The main reason renaming efforts are tedious by the way is our wrapping rules. Are there plugins for Sublime Text 2 that can do them automatically only for the affected lines? And then I guess undo them when a line really requires not to be wrapped...)\n\nPreviously: #1187.\n",
